actually, as I think,

00:53:43.840 --> 00:53:45.430
just push away past the brink.

00:53:45.430 --> 00:53:50.430
And I think we're gonna be
forced to reconsider this system

00:53:51.210 --> 00:53:52.043
that we've built.

00:53:52.043 --> 00:53:54.240
And I'm hoping that,

00:53:54.240 --> 00:53:58.370
I think we're gonna see a
