00:54:05.560 --> 00:54:09.240
Whether we choose to or not,
it's gonna be in our faces.

00:54:09.240 --> 00:54:13.600
So in some ways, I feel
hopeful about that.

00:54:13.600 --> 00:54:18.170
I also think, nationally
and internationally,

00:54:18.170 --> 00:54:22.230
